814\">B2H</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024402\">M1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1e</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024403\">M1C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1f</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024405\">M1D</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Recover the control unit/body computer assembly.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004866.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Work at the bench and release the retainers (1a) , separate the\njunction unit (1b) from the body computer.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004867.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the junction unit\nis not damaged and, if necessary, check the internal connections.</p><p>At the bench, connect the junction unit\nfrom the body computer and attach the retainers.</p><p>Connect 